### ============================================
### API Test File for VS Code REST Client
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@customerToken = YOUR_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE
@enterpriseAdminToken = YOUR_ENTERPRISE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@systemAdminToken = YOUR_SYSTEM_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Login as Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as EnterpriseAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "enterprise@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as SystemAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ============================================
### 2. WALLET APIs (Customer/EnterpriseAdmin)
### ============================================

### Get Wallet Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Get Wallet Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Deposit Money (VietQR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Nạp tiền vào ví"
}

### Pay Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 123,
  "description": "Thanh toán đơn hàng #123"
}

### Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 123,
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Hoàn tiền đơn hàng #123"
}

### Withdraw
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200000,
  "description": "Rút tiền từ ví"
}

### ============================================
### 3. WALLET REQUEST APIs
### ============================================

### Create Deposit Request (Customer/EnterpriseAdmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "deposit",
  "amount": 500000,
  "description": "Yêu cầu nạp tiền vào ví"
}

### Create Withdraw Request (Customer/EnterpriseAdmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "withdraw",
  "amount": 300000,
  "description": "Yêu cầu rút tiền từ ví"
}

### Get Wallet Requests (Customer/EnterpriseAdmin - own requests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest?status=pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Get Wallet Requests (SystemAdmin - all requests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest?status=pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Get Request Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Get Pending Requests Count (SystemAdmin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest/pending/count
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Approve Request (SystemAdmin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest/1/process
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Reject Request (SystemAdmin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/walletrequest/1/process
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject",
  "rejectionReason": "Thông tin không hợp lệ"
}

### ============================================
### 4. ORDERS APIs (EnterpriseAdmin)
### ============================================

### Get Orders (EnterpriseAdmin - với thông tin Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{enterpriseAdminToken}}

### Get Order Details (EnterpriseAdmin - với thông tin Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/123
Authorization: Bearer {{enterpriseAdminToken}}

### ============================================
### 5. SYSTEMADMIN WALLET MANAGEMENT APIs
### ============================================

### Get System Wallet Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/system/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Get All User Wallets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/system/users?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Get User Wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/user/123
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

### Update User Wallet Balance (Add money)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/user/123/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Bồi thường cho khách hàng"
}

### Update User Wallet Balance (Subtract money)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/user/123/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -50000,
  "description": "Phạt vi phạm quy định"
}

### Ensure All Users Have Wallets
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/system/ensure-all-wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}

